# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agentic Workflows & Multi-Agent Systems (Course Two)
#
# What IS tracked, deliberately:
#   course-outline-*.html   the single client-facing deliverable, and the sole
#                           source of truth (must stay exactly 1 A4 page)
#   presentation/           delivery decks — self-contained slide runners
#   hands-on/               lab notebooks, solutions and their generator
#   resources/              post-session video resources for participants
#   README.md               rationale, provenance and settled decisions
#
# Everything tracked here is ANONYMOUS by design: no tracked file, and no tracked
# FILENAME, names the client or the broker. Verified and scrubbed 2026-09-03 (the
# outline was renamed, the README rewritten, correspondence moved to _local/).
# Participants receive material from this folder — keep it that way, and re-run
# the check in CLAUDE.md before any push.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Working notes for this engagement. Local only — the only file in the folder
# that names the client and the broker, and it records commercial and delivery
# context that the tracked files must never carry.
CLAUDE.md

# Local Claude Code settings — machine-specific, not part of the deliverable.
.claude/
.claude/settings.local.json

# Correspondence, commercials and delivery notes. Local only, never tracked.
_local/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated / exported artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PDFs are rendered on demand when one needs to be sent, and are not committed
# (decision 2026-09-03). The page-count check writes to /tmp, but catch strays.
*.pdf
/tmp/
onepager.pdf

# Python bytecode from the lab generator and verifiers
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Jupyter working state. Notebooks are committed WITHOUT outputs — if a diff
# shows execution counts or output blobs, re-run _generators/regenerate.sh.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — never commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
credentials.*
secrets.*
*token*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
